00:26:18.238 --> 00:26:19.114
Tom: Ya.

00:26:19.155 --> 00:26:20.365
John: Mencari kerja?

00:26:20.407 --> 00:26:21.199
Tom: Saya.

00:26:21.241 --> 00:26:22.450
John: Kamu tahu apa yang kita lakukan?

00:26:22.492 --> 00:26:23.326
Tom: Ya.

00:26:23.368 --> 00:26:25.370
John: Hadir besok pagi.

00:26:25.412 --> 00:26:26.413
Tom: Deal.

00:26:26.454 --> 00:26:28.623
John: Baik.

00:26:31.584 --> 00:26:33.169
man: Aku tidak pernah mengerti kenapa

00:26:33.211 --> 00:26:36.214
he uses those young, dumb kids.

00:26:36.256 --> 00:26:38.299
Ray: Tidak bisa?

00:26:38.341 --> 00:26:43.346
Gretchen:

00:26:48.685 --> 00:26:49.769
You do still love me,

00:26:49.811 --> 00:26:51.396
don't you ?

00:26:51.438 --> 00:26:53.148
Tom: Pasti.

00:26:53.189 --> 00:26:54.190
Gretchen: Lalu apa

00:26:54.232 --> 00:26:55.692
the problem ?

00:26:55.734 --> 00:26:57.277
I mean, how else are you gonna

00:26:57.318 --> 00:26:58.486
get that kind of money,

00:26:58.528 --> 00:26:59.487
rob a bank ?

00:26:59.529 --> 00:27:01.614
Look, okay,

00:27:01.656 --> 00:27:04.075
the guy creeps me out too,

00:27:04.117 --> 00:27:06.786
tapi kamu sekarang sudah jadi laki-laki besar.

00:27:06.828 --> 00:27:09.748
Kamu bisa mengurus orang itu.

00:27:34.272 --> 00:27:36.149
Fred:

00:27:40.695 --> 00:27:42.572
Shit !

00:27:59.297 --> 00:28:00.632
John: Fred ?

00:28:00.674 --> 00:28:02.092
Fred: Pipa itu memompa

00:28:02.133 --> 00:28:04.427
cairan berbau busuk ke dalam--

00:28:04.469 --> 00:28:06.262
itu mencemari kebun saya !

00:28:06.304 --> 00:28:07.555
Dan serangga itu, mereka

00:28:07.597 --> 00:28:08.890
besar seperti kelinci jahat.

00:28:08.932 --> 00:28:10.558
John: Aku akan mengurusnya.

00:28:10.600 --> 00:28:11.476
Fred: Kamu seperti

00:28:11.518 --> 00:28:12.310
piringan yang macet.

00:28:12.352 --> 00:28:13.311
Aku akan menggugatmu

00:28:13.353 --> 00:28:14.312
kaki jancuk, porky.

00:28:14.354 --> 00:28:17.148
Kamu bajingan !

00:28:17.190 --> 00:28:20.151
John: Yesus...

00:28:44.092 --> 00:28:45.343
Eddie: Pak Gacy ?

00:28:45.385 --> 00:28:46.302
John: Ya.

00:28:46.344 --> 00:28:48.304
Eddie: Eddie Bloom,

00:28:48.346 --> 00:28:49.305
kontrol hama.

00:28:49.347 --> 00:28:50.557
Kami sudah bicara.

00:28:50.598 --> 00:28:52.267
John: Oh, ya, ya, ya.

00:28:52.308 --> 00:28:53.393
Masuk saja.

00:28:53.435 --> 00:28:54.561
Eddie: Aku dengar kamu punya

00:28:54.602 --> 00:28:55.687
masalah kecil.

00:28:55.729 --> 00:28:57.313
John: Tentu saja.

00:29:08.283 --> 00:29:09.617
Eddie: Berhenti, jangan nyalakan

00:29:09.659 --> 00:29:10.827
lampunya.

00:29:10.869 --> 00:29:12.620
Aku akan mengejutkan mereka.

00:29:29.721 --> 00:29:31.598
Sialan!

00:30:20.230 --> 00:30:21.981
Aku menagih dia dua kali

00:30:22.023 --> 00:30:23.483
untuk ini.

00:30:47.674 --> 00:30:50.051
Bucholtz: Apakah kamu John Gacy?

00:30:50.093 --> 00:30:51.594
John: Ya, saya.

00:30:51.636 --> 00:30:53.221
Bucholtz: Saya Petugas Bucholtz,

00:30:53.263 --> 00:30:54.305
ini Petugas Wolf.

00:30:54.347 --> 00:30:55.724
John: Apa yang bisa saya lakukan untuk kalian

00:30:55.765 --> 00:30:56.516
